- @campaigning_menu: Time to hit the campaign trail!
- @hope: Let's hope Germany will make the correct choice.


@campaigning_menu

We have a plethora of campaign options at our disposal.

- @campaigning
- @newspaper
- @radio
- @iron_front
- @hope: Let's hope Germany will make the correct choice.


@campaigning
title: Accelerate campaign efforts in general.
subtitle: This will cost us 1 resource.
view-if: not campaigning_seen
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; campaigning_seen = 1; campaigning_count = 0
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaign_menu

@campaign_menu

Since it's election season, we are able to accelerate campaigning efforts. Buy one campaign, get another one completely free of charge!

- @workers: Add 1 "Worker" to the cart.
- @middle_class: Add 1 "Middle Class" to the cart.
- @rural: Add 1 "Rural" to the cart.
- @unemployed: Add "Unemployed" to the cart.
- @catholics: Add "Catholic" to the cart.
- @checkout

@workers
view-if: campaigning_count < 2
on-arrival: workers_dvp += 2*(1 - dissent); campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu

@middle_class
view-if: campaigning_count < 2
on-arrival: new_middle_dvp += 6*(1 - dissent); old_middle_dvp += 7*(1 - dissent); campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu

@rural
view-if: campaigning_count < 2
on-arrival: rural_dvp += 3*(1 - dissent); campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu

@unemployed
view-if: campaigning_count < 2
on-arrival: unemployed_dvp += 1*(1 - dissent); campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu

@catholics
view-if: campaigning_count < 2 and peoples_party
on-arrival: catholics_dvp += 3*(1 - dissent); campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu

@checkout
title: Checkout your order.
go-to: campaigning_menu


@newspaper
title: Use our newspapers!
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: newspaper
on-arrival: resources -= 1; new_middle_dvp += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_dvp += 4*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 1*(1-dissent) if dvp_left >= 0
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaigning_menu

Our newspapers allow us to gain more support for our candidate.


@radio
title: Use our radio station!
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio
on-arrival: resources -= 1; new_middle_dvp += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_dvp += 6*(1 - dissent); workers_dvp += 1*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent) if dvp_left >= 0
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaigning_menu

Our radio station allows us to gain more support for our candidate.


@iron_front
title: Cooperate with the Iron Front!
subtitle: We can be more effective if we cooperate with more left-wing republicans.
choose-if: spd_relation >= 50 and dvp_campaign != "Jarres" or dvp_campaign != "Westarp"
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations with the <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> are not good enough.
view-if: iron_front_formed and dvp_left >= 0 and dvp_candidate = spd_candidate
on-arrival: workers_spd += 2; new_middle_spd += 3; rural_z += 4 if z_candidate = dvp_candidate; new_middle_ddp += 5 if ddp_exist and ddp_candidate = dvp_candidate; old_middle_ddp += 3 if ddp_exist and ddp_candidate = dvp_candidate; new_middle_dvp += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_dvp += 2*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 4*(1-dissent)
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaigning_menu

Our cooperation allows us to greatly increase support for our unity candidate.


@hope

Where has hope got us the past few years?
